  <p><span class="mr-[0.45rem] inline-block size-[0.6rem] rounded-full bg-accent" aria-hidden="true"></span> Open to thoughtful engineering conversations.</p>
  <div class="flex justify-end gap-6 max-mobile:flex-wrap max-mobile:justify-start">
    <a href="mailto:brijeshbhakta30@gmail.com">Email</a>
    <a href="https://github.com/brijeshbhakta30" rel="me">GitHub</a>
    <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/brijeshbhakta/" rel="me">LinkedIn</a>
    <a href="https://x.com/brijeshbhakta30" rel="me">X / Twitter</a>
  </div>
  <p class="col-span-full mt-12 mb-0 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2 font-mono text-[0.8rem] tracking-[0.05em] text-muted uppercase max-mobile:mt-4">
    <MadeWithLove />
    <span aria-hidden="true">·</span>
